lerte est justifiée : vous voyez le texte extrait, l’explication et la source du raisonnement, jamais un verdict sans motivation.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"ljtblw","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<style>
.lj-table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}
.lj-cmp{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;background:#fff;
  border:1px solid rgba(27,42,74,.10);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;
  font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;color:#39445A;line-height:1.55;min-width:640px}
.lj-cmp th{background:#1B2A4A;color:#fff;font-family:'Roboto Slab',serif;font-weight:600;
  padding:14px 16px;text-align:left;font-size:14px}
.lj-cmp td{padding:13px 16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,42,74,.08);vertical-align:top}
.lj-cmp tr td:first-child{font-weight:600;color:#1C1C1C;white-space:nowrap}
</style>
<div class="lj-table-wrap"><table class="lj-cmp">
<thead><tr><th>Anomalie détectée</th><th>Exemple typique</th><th>Ce que propose l’outil</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Clause à risque</td>
<td>Limitation de responsabilité déséquilibrée, pénalités asymétriques, résiliation unilatérale.</td>
<td>Explication du risque, références utiles, reformulation argumentée prête à copier.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Clause manquante</td>
<td>Absence de clause de confidentialité, de résiliation ou de droit applicable.</td>
<td>Suggestion d’insertion à partir de votre bibliothèque de clauses de référence.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Déséquilibre significatif</td>
<td>Stipulations créant un déséquilibre au sens de l’article 1171 du Code civil.</td>
<td>Signalement motivé et proposition de rééquilibrage, à votre appréciation.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Écart de version</td>
<td>Modification glissée par le cocontractant entre deux tours de négociation.</td>
<td>Comparaison avec vos versions antérieures : les écarts ressortent, façon redlining.</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"ljtblb","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Essayez la révision gratuitement","align":"center","link":{"url":"https://www.lumenjuris.com/contactez-nous/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"700","background_color":"#1B2A4A","button_text_color":"#FFFFFF","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"8","right":"8","bottom":"8","left":"8","isLinked":true},"text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"14","right":"28","bottom":"14","left":"28","isLinked":false},"typography_text_decoration":"none"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljtmo9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","background_background":"classic","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"60","right":"40","bottom":"60","left":"40","isLinked":false},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"20","bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":35,"column":"35","row":"35"},"flex_align_items_mobile":"center","margin_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"20","bottom":"20","left":"20","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"ljtmoh","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Un outil juridique IA pensé pour votre pratique","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"700","align":"center","title_color":"#000000","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljtmoi","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>De la relecture de contrat en ligne ponctuelle à l’audit de contrat systématique, la révision s’adapte au volume et aux enjeux de chaque pra