d_active_icon":{"value":"fas fa-minus","library":"fa-solid"},"title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":17,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_font_weight":"600","normal_title_color":"#1C1C1C","accordion_background_background":"classic","accordion_background_color":"#FFFFFF","accordion_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"accordion_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"18","right":"22","bottom":"18","left":"22","isLinked":false},"space_between_widgets":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"accordion_item_title_space_between":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"max_items_expended":"multiple"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqc0","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Oui, dans un cadre précis : l’IA de Lumen Juris analyse chaque clause à partir des sources publiques du droit français (Légifrance, jurisprudence) et justifie chaque alerte. Elle constitue une aide à la décision fiable pour préparer la revue, hiérarchiser les risques et proposer des reformulations. Aucun outil ne garantit toutefois une détection exhaustive : la validation finale relève du professionnel.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc1","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>L’analyse de contrat établit un diagnostic : clauses à risque détectées, score de conformité, explications. La révision contractuelle va plus loin : elle propose la correction, reformulations argumentées, insertion de clauses manquantes depuis votre bibliothèque, comparaison avec les versions antérieures, puis réinjecte le contrat corrigé dans son circuit : négociation, signature, contrathèque.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc2","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt2","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Non, et elle n’est pas conçue pour cela. La révision par IA prépare le travail : elle lit l’intégralité du document, signale les points de vigilance et documente chaque alerte. Le professionnel du droit garde l’appréciation juridique et la décision. L’outil fournit une aide à la décision, pas un conseil juridique : il fait gagner le temps de lecture, pas l’expertise.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc3","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt3","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Non. Les documents que vous importez dans Lumen Juris ne servent jamais à entraîner nos modèles ni ceux de tiers. L’IA est entraînée sur les données publiques ouvertes du droit français, Légifrance, jurisprudence de la Cour de cassation et des cours d’appel, open data de l’État. Vos contrats sont hébergés en France et traités conformément au RGPD.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc4","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt4","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Les contrats d’affaires courants : prestation de services, NDA, contrats de travail, baux, partenariats, contrats fournisseurs. L’outil porte une attention particulière aux clauses sensibles, responsabilité, résiliation, non-concurrence, indemnisation, confidentialité, et aux déséquilibres significatifs au sens de l’article 1171 du Code civil, sans prétendre à l’exhaustivité sur des montages atypiques.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc5","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt5","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Les formats PDF et Word sont pris en charge à l’import. Vous pouvez aussi réviser un contrat rédigé directement dans Lumen Juris avec le générateur : le document passe alors de la rédaction à la révision sans export ni conversion, et conserve son historique dans la plateforme.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc6","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt6","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Oui. La révision confronte le document reçu à vos versions antérieures et met en évidence les écarts, clauses modifiées, ajoutées ou supprimées entre deux tours de négociation, à la manière d’un redlining automatisé. Vous voyez immédiatement ce que le cocontractant a changé, et l’analyse se concentre sur ces écarts.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc7","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt7","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Vous pouvez essayer gratuitement la révision contractuelle de Lumen Juris : importez un contrat et découvrez l’analyse clause par clause, le score de conformité et les reformulations proposées. L’essai est sans engagement, il permet de juger la pertinence de l’outil sur vos propres documents avant toute décision.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}]}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljcta9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_align_items":"center","background_background":"gradient","background_color":"#EAF1F9","background_color_b":"#A4BFDF","background_gradient_angle":{"unit":"deg","size":135,"sizes":[]},"min_height":{"unit":"px","size":360,"sizes":[]},"flex_justify_content":"center","background_overlay_background":"classic","background_overlay_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"-17","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"ljctah","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Révisez votre prochain contrat par IA","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","title_color":"#1C1C1C","typography_text_transform":"uppercase","text_stroke_text_stroke_type":"yes","align_mobile":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljctat","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Essayez gratuitement la révision contractuelle par IA de Lumen Juris : importez un contrat PDF ou Word, mesurez la pertinence de la détection de clauses à risque sur vos propres documents, et gardez le contrat dans son cycle complet, génération, révision, négociation, signature électronique, contrathèque. La relecture reste la vôtre ; le temps de lecture, lui, n’est plus perdu.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#000000","align":"center","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"41c801f","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Demandez une démo","link":{"url":"https://www.lumenjuris.com/contactez-nous/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_style":"normal","typography_text_decoration":"none","background_color":"#FFFFFF","button_box_shadow_box_shadow_type":"yes","button_box_shadow_box_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":10,"spread":0,"color":"rgba(230.81748962402344, 229.81393532131028, 229.81393532131028, 0.5)"},"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"6","right":"6","bottom":"6","left":"6","isLinked":true}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false}]
